  "translatedAt": "2026-08-31T02:51:51.697Z",
  "title": "DynamicMotion Display Templates [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "DynamicMotion 表示系テンプレート【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "b8ee8f72fa030907c1bebf45cfe4751b76543bf0dd72d7997d51c54e8196e40b",
      "translation": "DynamicMotion Display Templates [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "b8ee8f72fa030907c1bebf45cfe4751b76543bf0dd72d7997d51c54e8196e40b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "表示系のテンプレートを紹介していきます。",
      "sourceHash": "758a9fdbdb2bd6b8a1e76f02336dc4158e0d415e9fc2d1fc0b0a8a7be3a8d9e2",
      "translation": "I will introduce display-related templates.",
      "contextHash": "758a9fdbdb2bd6b8a1e76f02336dc4158e0d415e9fc2d1fc0b0a8a7be3a8d9e2"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※ver表記はＭＶ版DynamicMotionが基準ですが、全てDynamicMotionMZでも有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "5e09a6ef29902d47f57c2f7a0c818a7ea4b00b5e50b4cd6c86dc2c4730e9d127",
      "translation": "※The version notation is based on the MV version of DynamicMotion, but all of them are also valid for DynamicMotionMZ.",
      "contextHash": "5e09a6ef29902d47f57c2f7a0c818a7ea4b00b5e50b4cd6c86dc2c4730e9d127"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "透明（invisible）",
      "sourceHash": "d0f76426927ea06087f86b4b0d734b72f11a6d46c42d093b52a9a3964aeaf0ed",
      "translation": "Transparency (invisible)",
      "contextHash": "d0f76426927ea06087f86b4b0d734b72f11a6d46c42d093b52a9a3964aeaf0ed"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "バトラーを透明化します。",
      "sourceHash": "e46604cb936538ac6a645574d482a3b219ef1bfe0b2ad4e6b881fe6bd65e09d7",
      "translation": "Makes the battler transparent.",
      "contextHash": "e46604cb936538ac6a645574d482a3b219ef1bfe0b2ad4e6b881fe6bd65e09d7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "解除するには、下の『透明解除（visible）』を指定する必要があります。",
      "sourceHash": "b6294a362b76ff080cca873d2cb1ba8f3ba653f7475e004c4dcefdd537dda11a",
      "translation": "To undo this, you need to specify “Transparency Off (visible)” below.",
      "contextHash": "b6294a362b76ff080cca873d2cb1ba8f3ba653f7475e004c4dcefdd537dda11a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-003",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "透明解除（visible）",
      "sourceHash": "a1c31fbd3584eaa1cd7eabd1884ea07d667eaa81a10d099100423807943df5fd",
      "translation": "Transparency Off (visible)",
      "contextHash": "a1c31fbd3584eaa1cd7eabd1884ea07d667eaa81a10d099100423807943df5fd"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "透明状態を解除します。",
      "sourceHash": "19b5a0dea770efdafdbaae2caa1ae05691af1bb50e902aa79c79fd525a5e3ff2",
      "translation": "Removes the transparent state.",
      "contextHash": "19b5a0dea770efdafdbaae2caa1ae05691af1bb50e902aa79c79fd525a5e3ff2"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-001",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "/> // 透明化しながら前進",
      "sourceHash": "ef518c9dbb4f270629f387a5606a6dec84a3bb68a928986e2ac7d097467f8b83",
      "translation": "/> // Move forward while becoming transparent",
      "contextHash": "3f9cd4e0a493b402d1f1a874873827741f20395f01059acf24d606e77cb1f5df"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-002",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "ex += 48 * mirroring // 対象の少し手前に移動",
      "sourceHash": "3a3b87c4b7335c1c91a54528546020f2787587b4522a4766e44fbaf8a1dcfd94",
      "translation": "ex += 48 * mirroring // Move to just before the target",
      "contextHash": "3a3b87c4b7335c1c91a54528546020f2787587b4522a4766e44fbaf8a1dcfd94"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-003",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "&attack/> // 透明解除しながら前進アタック",
      "sourceHash": "a079fb878ad47587a012e98bad36437b0f68c0afd7c37847cd8a9d081d5fc368",
      "translation": "&attack/> // Advance attack while removing transparency",
      "contextHash": "c232b8c429554d050835f72daf030ae1167e4a70a4d89cc4698b71771460ddd1"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-004",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:return/> // 戻る",
      "sourceHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:return/> // Return",
      "contextHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-006",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "透明と透明解除を組み合わせてみました。",
      "sourceHash": "aa99886f7d9cbe3395c6f74bbc85e3cec47bb94575ec41d39865d7a45aa91e1f",
      "translation": "I combined transparency and transparency off.",
      "contextHash": "aa99886f7d9cbe3395c6f74bbc85e3cec47bb94575ec41d39865d7a45aa91e1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-004",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "反転（mirror）",
      "sourceHash": "1c9ae828a7526526ff9685f88409105eedd8878beced92ea7622a3af3c828855",
      "translation": "Mirror (mirror)",
      "contextHash": "1c9ae828a7526526ff9685f88409105eedd8878beced92ea7622a3af3c828855"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "バトラーを左右反転します。",
      "sourceHash": "f414c49ab98adcea22ca4bea29c999144cb99beeb668ae1b7100c180c445c23f",
      "translation": "Mirrors the battler horizontally.",
      "contextHash": "f414c49ab98adcea22ca4bea29c999144cb99beeb668ae1b7100c180c445c23f"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-005",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "&near/> // 左右反転して対象へ接近",
      "sourceHash": "194c45646c49bd6d336d3589d8a77fc2df172c35c586e4e053d04d5537267f5a",
      "translation": "&near/> // Flip horizontally and approach the target",
      "contextHash": "c7cb4ae035284cf6677070b1f3cc1f26c9ed6379c1cec5780d58cfbfebf2c898"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-006",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-007",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:return/> // 戻る",
      "sourceHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:return/> // Return",
      "contextHash": "7f77ad63a3571415d6633e4cb0e448eb7b1086778df4ed4c31a04796120bd082"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "味方を対象としたスキルやアイテムなどに利用できます。",
      "sourceHash": "03362488e78842781392b065c1fd6623b16ac1c6bbcacb1a460b0e7a23e5ab90",
      "translation": "This can be used for skills and items that target allies.",
      "contextHash": "03362488e78842781392b065c1fd6623b16ac1c6bbcacb1a460b0e7a23e5ab90"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "攻撃とも組み合わせられますが、武器を振る腕まで変わるので注意です。",
      "sourceHash": "fdef89f8283ac5b5333970a78ab8259af2edc43f392b3469f0839f4b0ad46a1f",
      "translation": "It can also be combined with attacks, but be careful, as even the arm wielding the weapon will change.",
      "contextHash": "fdef89f8283ac5b5333970a78ab8259af2edc43f392b3469f0839f4b0ad46a1f"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、左右反転は解除するまで戻りません。下の『反転解除（mirrorOff）』を指定する必要があります。",
      "sourceHash": "f276c5353b84de18ff6e6875f2da29e292d88a802b844610307e3e876112eb91",
      "translation": "The horizontal mirror will not be undone until it is canceled. You need to specify “Mirror Off (mirrorOff)” below.",
      "contextHash": "f276c5353b84de18ff6e6875f2da29e292d88a802b844610307e3e876112eb91"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "あるいは、例のように『帰還（return）』型で自動解除するので、そちらに任せるのもオススメです。",
      "sourceHash": "a23b8fb0d77e0056176626c0f5cad41027423451c11df564a6db6aae7ee2ba71",
      "translation": "Alternatively, as in the example, it is automatically undone by the “Return (return)” type, so I recommend leaving it to that.",
      "contextHash": "a23b8fb0d77e0056176626c0f5cad41027423451c11df564a6db6aae7ee2ba71"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "反転解除（mirrorOff）",
      "sourceHash": "f0a8431178be459996e2a101a806c5d3aa28ab4c659bd98bed79ec177636c7e8",
      "translation": "Mirror Off (mirrorOff)",
      "contextHash": "f0a8431178be459996e2a101a806c5d3aa28ab4c659bd98bed79ec177636c7e8"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "バトラーの左右反転を解除します。",
      "sourceHash": "099a095333d6dbbaaf1e37658a28a47206ee30395084f57242f00088e283df97",
      "translation": "Cancels the battler’s horizontal mirror.",
      "contextHash": "099a095333d6dbbaaf1e37658a28a47206ee30395084f57242f00088e283df97"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-008",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:mirror&near/> // 左右反転して対象へ接近",
      "sourceHash": "c7cb4ae035284cf6677070b1f3cc1f26c9ed6379c1cec5780d58cfbfebf2c898",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:mirror&near/> // Flip horizontally and approach the target",
      "contextHash": "c7cb4ae035284cf6677070b1f3cc1f26c9ed6379c1cec5780d58cfbfebf2c898"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-009",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:mirrorOff/> // 左右反転解除",
      "sourceHash": "7894965e39afbc6f22e743e5e68f1a817d90f5a6b99482b1a4cbe69fee58377a",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:mirrorOff/> // Stop flipping horizontally",
      "contextHash": "7894965e39afbc6f22e743e5e68f1a817d90f5a6b99482b1a4cbe69fee58377a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "自分ズーム（zoomA）ver1.021",
      "sourceHash": "c1f07a99163415038e28112e4f2a7e438104a4c05e536a4115739dec2de1de3b",
      "translation": "Self Zoom (zoomA) ver1.021",
      "contextHash": "c1f07a99163415038e28112e4f2a7e438104a4c05e536a4115739dec2de1de3b"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "行動主体にズームします。",
      "sourceHash": "741011d7024f2fd47cbdcff4537eb9772a0e43700baacb6e2c500f748e9ce854",
      "translation": "Zooms in on the action subject.",
      "contextHash": "741011d7024f2fd47cbdcff4537eb9772a0e43700baacb6e2c500f748e9ce854"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "対象ズーム（zoomB）ver1.021",
      "sourceHash": "ce5091d4ab89d55f11c40c84871108e241739e07547e3fecc51c138c38718e72",
      "translation": "Target Zoom (zoomB) ver1.021",
      "contextHash": "ce5091d4ab89d55f11c40c84871108e241739e07547e3fecc51c138c38718e72"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "対象にズームします。",
      "sourceHash": "42adb83936fa8e608e2a19129cf28830d531806b910c3087a29a2ae12b89bf53",
      "translation": "Zooms in on the target.",
      "contextHash": "42adb83936fa8e608e2a19129cf28830d531806b910c3087a29a2ae12b89bf53"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『行動主体がA』『対象がB』というのは、スキルの計算式と同じです。混同しそうな時はそれで覚えるとオススメです。",
      "sourceHash": "197cd2d02d1bf9900092859d924bac45d33972b1356d215ab3f819c03a7c17c5",
      "translation": " \"The action subject is A” and “the target is B” are the same as in a skill’s formula. If you are likely to confuse them, I recommend remembering them this way.",
      "contextHash": "197cd2d02d1bf9900092859d924bac45d33972b1356d215ab3f819c03a7c17c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ズーム解除（zoomOff）ver1.021",
      "sourceHash": "ea46aa8f75f92b368bf7f44eb42a21c0a90c273a553ade7f2145a449ad3bb6f7",
      "translation": "Zoom Off (zoomOff) ver1.021",
      "contextHash": "ea46aa8f75f92b368bf7f44eb42a21c0a90c273a553ade7f2145a449ad3bb6f7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ズームを解除します。",
      "sourceHash": "0594b4673ff8eb24255e96d9870b563afe57776c8ff309afd9fa04bf59cb119d",
      "translation": "Cancels the zoom.",
      "contextHash": "0594b4673ff8eb24255e96d9870b563afe57776c8ff309afd9fa04bf59cb119d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下、自分ズーム、対象ズームとそれぞれ組み合わせた例です。",
      "sourceHash": "87a9ca314c4fd544c79a3b766724e9d22a27d1c77bda15592f4654dad0acf2a5",
      "translation": "Here are examples combining it with self zoom and target zoom, respectively.",
      "contextHash": "87a9ca314c4fd544c79a3b766724e9d22a27d1c77bda15592f4654dad0acf2a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-010",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:zoomA/> // 自分にズーム",
      "sourceHash": "94342ed231466324e660ead4ef70d5e6b767f766b17a06e0ef4e7541d6a25af8",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:zoomA/> // Zoom in on self",
      "contextHash": "94342ed231466324e660ead4ef70d5e6b767f766b17a06e0ef4e7541d6a25af8"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-011",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation:wait/> // アニメーション＆ウェイト",
      "sourceHash": "08a7cb96735048882df67974d7ffeb28e061363f54a928b9525b20d017578dc1",
      "translation": "<D-Animation:wait/> // Animation & wait",
      "contextHash": "08a7cb96735048882df67974d7ffeb28e061363f54a928b9525b20d017578dc1"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-012",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:zoomOff/> // ズーム解除",
      "sourceHash": "e14b70c3a063f61c5039e6a748ba23174bcfbf57d6dcdbcadc70d1897b8fad0e",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:zoomOff/> // Reset zoom",
      "contextHash": "e14b70c3a063f61c5039e6a748ba23174bcfbf57d6dcdbcadc70d1897b8fad0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-013",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "/> // 対象にズーム",
      "sourceHash": "9222dd76ba51b28f0e3305cb6cf2e0dd3185d82dc7c90e9435d1aaa256d9a2e6",
      "translation": "/> // Zoom in on the target",
      "contextHash": "f11da4bb51361557aae918b8f2562ea4f43450a0652515d7126fcbc6482809b2"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-014",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack/> // 武器振り",
      "sourceHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack/> // Weapon swing",
      "contextHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-015",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-016",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "/> // ズーム解除",
      "sourceHash": "44e5e6f081c563c968a4a32c91ed32c3c4a66e9b77d65d390c4f487024d5f6be",
      "translation": "/> // Reset zoom",
      "contextHash": "fbba095f9507ecd4ac15a3bcd59b76539c068b7e42590266252ccf65e65834fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "振動（shake）ver1.03",
      "sourceHash": "3aa62f3e22149fad8911ffee572fa51f12c97ef68c8a6ad6461f213bb93c0f9d",
      "translation": "Shake (shake) ver1.03",
      "contextHash": "3aa62f3e22149fad8911ffee572fa51f12c97ef68c8a6ad6461f213bb93c0f9d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "モーション対象を振動させます。振動幅は左右合わせて６ピクセルです。",
      "sourceHash": "ac3bc4a486e8069f818b35ff103814b76452e833520677faf88fc8b8300ee267",
      "translation": "Shakes the motion target. The total horizontal shake amplitude is 6 pixels.",
      "contextHash": "ac3bc4a486e8069f818b35ff103814b76452e833520677faf88fc8b8300ee267"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-017",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Animation/> // アニメーション",
      "sourceHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e",
      "translation": "<D-Animation/> // Animation",
      "contextHash": "9802d743a907fc00058dbb5f86576dc1a630c049e1bf1207540d96cd574e974e"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-018",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "<D-Motion:attack/> // 武器振り",
      "sourceHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9",
      "translation": "<D-Motion:attack/> // Weapon swing",
      "contextHash": "a8304627f0702d55a4fc9699a5fbfbe47148fc255006bd2ecae2a9dac17cd6b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-019",
      "type": "code",
      "source": "/> // 対象を振動",
      "sourceHash": "03e185ff273f6db87ceccd36eff6b911510a539254c17931dcd91da2a6287a46",
      "translation": "/> // Shake the target",
      "contextHash": "7d2c6a0d8171013f58e0231856bc48fc7c9cdc04c489e83834a9db1f67684be5"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、振動幅を大きくしたい時は『addX』に値をかけます。",
      "sourceHash": "c29288d037509f6db6877a42771e521ea8dfe96f87f6da0d0c1e46d478a946e4",
      "translation": "Also, when you want to increase the shake amplitude, multiply “addX” by a value.",
